@fact mir.artificer
# en: An artificer who smells of solder and ozone and has started at least one small fire.
text [6f21ba] = 一个浑身焊锡和臭氧味的奇械师，至少引发过一场小火灾。

@fact mir.owl
# en: Built a clockwork owl that remembers deadlines, birthdays and, slightly, grudges.
text [841167] = 造过一只发条猫头鹰，能记住截止日期、生日，还有一点点的仇。
# en: Ask what their clockwork owl remembers.
hint [1dd2b1] = 问问那只发条猫头鹰都记得些什么。

@fact mir.notebooks
# en: Three years of notebooks are the most precious things they own.
text [9a3403] = 三年的笔记本是 TA 最珍贵的东西。
# en: Get close enough to be shown the notebooks.
hint [11d04f] = 熟到能让他们给你看那些笔记本。

@fact mir.family
# en: Their family runs a clockworks and thinks invention is a hobby. It is not a hobby.
text [91fa32] = TA 家开着一间钟表工坊，觉得发明只是个爱好。这不是爱好。
# en: Ask about the family business.
hint [c0a040] = 问问家里的生意。

@fact mir.name_day
# en: Nobody ever remembered their name day before.
text [40158a] = 以前从没有人记得 TA 的命名日。
# en: Find out when their name day is.
hint [f96769] = 打听一下他们的命名日是哪天。

@fact mir.workshop
# en: After the third fire in a term, the faculty padlocked their workshop.
text [14af34] = 一个学期里第三次失火之后，教职员给 TA 的工坊上了挂锁。
# en: Count the fires this term.
hint [5329ce] = 数数这学期着了几次火。

@fact mir.corridor
# en: Locked out of a workshop, they will solder on the corridor floor for a week rather than stop. It's character-building, they say.
text [be7fd4] = 被锁在工坊外面，TA 宁可在走廊地板上焊一个星期，也不肯停下。TA 说，这能磨炼品格。
# en: See what they do when the door is locked.
hint [d51d70] = 看看门锁上时 TA 会怎么做。

@fact mir.properly
# en: At the family bench Mir works "properly": slow, silent and perfect, the way they never do at the castle. Their real workshop at home is a cupboard under the attic stairs.
text [b754af] = 在家里的工作台前，米尔“规规矩矩”地干活：慢、安静、完美，跟在城堡里完全不一样。TA在家真正的工坊是阁楼楼梯下的一个柜子。
# en: Visit them at the family bench.
hint [38f5e4] = 去家里的工作台看看TA。

@fact mir.drawer
# en: Their father keeps every invention Mir made as a child in a drawer marked "M.", labelled and oiled. He has never mentioned it to them.
text [cb617f] = TA的父亲把米尔小时候做的每一件发明都收在一个标着“米”字的抽屉里，贴好标签，上好油。他从没跟TA提过。
# en: Find what their father keeps.
hint [da27fe] = 找找TA父亲收着什么。

@fact mir.sister
# en: Their older sister Greta will inherit the clockworks and is very good at it. She has never once been allowed to set anything on fire.
text [3ff1e5] = TA的姐姐格蕾塔将来要接手钟表坊，而且干得非常好。她从来没被允许点着过任何东西。
# en: Meet the one who does it properly.
hint [f3b6fa] = 见见那个规规矩矩的人。
